{
  "characters": [
    "Charles",
    "Clara",
    "Margaret",
    "Diana",
    "William"
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Heavy rain beats against the tall windows of the dining hall. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "A long wooden table is set with candles and wine glasses, with one empty chair right next to Charles.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Forty days have passed since Nathaniel died. ",
          "pacing": 0.05,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "With their only heir gone and the Great Depression of 1930 ruining their family business, the Blackwoods are on the edge of losing everything. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonight, Charles has gathered everyone in the house for a quiet memorial dinner.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "expression": "normal",
      "position": "left"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "Clara",
      "expression": "sad",
      "position": "right"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Charles stands at the head of the table, holding up a glass bottle of dark red wine. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Behind him, Clara, looking pale and tired, pours the wine for Margaret, Diana, and the rest of the staff.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Tonight, we remember my son, Nathaniel—the true heir of Blackwood. ",
          "pacing": 0.055,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.25
        },
        {
          "text": "Even in these hard times, our family name will survive. ",
          "pacing": 0.055,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.25
        },
        {
          "text": "Drink, all of you, to his memory and to a fresh start.",
          "pacing": 0.055,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "UnloadSprite",
      "speaker": "Clara"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "Margaret",
      "expression": "sad",
      "position": "right"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "None of them know that Charles has mixed a heavy dose of sleeping drugs. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Margaret drinks hers quickly, her hands shaking.",
          "pacing": 0.05,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "UnloadSprite",
      "speaker": "Margaret"
    },
    {
      "name": "UnloadSprite",
      "speaker": "Charles"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Thirty minutes later, the dining hall goes completely silent. ",
          "pacing": 0.05,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "One by one, Margaret and the servants slump over the table or fall onto the floor in a deep sleep.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "expression": "normal",
      "position": "center"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Charles stands alone among the unconscious bodies, breathing hard, his eyes locked on his family painting.",
          "pacing": 0.05,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "UnloadSprite",
      "speaker": "Charles"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "William",
      "expression": "sad",
      "position": "center"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Upstairs in William's bedroom, a tray of untouched food and a full glass of wine sit cold on the side table. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "William lies awake in bed, staring at the ceiling, crushed by guilt over Nathaniel's death and the loss of Walter.",
          "pacing": 0.05,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "*Scrape... Thud...*",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "William",
      "expression": "surprised",
      "position": "center"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Suddenly, a heavy dragging sound echoes up from the main stairs below. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "A strong, foul smell of sulfur, blood, and dirty lake water creeps under the crack of his bedroom door.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "William sits up slowly, his heart pounding fast. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "He walks to the door and cracks it open, looking out into the dark hallway.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "William creeps quietly down the stairs toward the main hall, following the wet drag marks smeared across the wooden floor.",
          "pacing": 0.05,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Through the half-open doors of the ritual room, a strange, sickly yellow light flickers on the stone walls. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "William peeks through the gap.",
          "pacing": 0.05,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "In the middle of the stone floor, a blank canvas stands in front of a freshly painted Yellow Sign. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Around the edge of the circle lie the unconscious bodies of Margaret, Clara, and the servants, all except one empty spot.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "UnloadSprite",
      "speaker": "William"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "expression": "normal",
      "position": "center"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Charles stands beside the canvas, holding a silver knife in one hand and a porcelain mask in the other.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Everything is set. ",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.25
        },
        {
          "text": "Only the final piece remains. ",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.25
        },
        {
          "text": "He must be in place before the first stroke is painted...",
          "pacing": 0.065,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "expression": "surprised",
      "position": "left"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "William",
      "expression": "surprised",
      "position": "right"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Charles turns sharply toward the doorway, intending to go upstairs and drag William down to complete the circle—and freezes as he spots William's pale face peeking through the gap.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "expression": "happy",
      "position": "left"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Charles",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "William! ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "emphasis",
          "pause_after": 0.2
        },
        {
          "text": "You're already here... Good. ",
          "pacing": 0.055,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.25
        },
        {
          "text": "You didn't drink the wine. ",
          "pacing": 0.055,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.25
        },
        {
          "text": "Stay right there!",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "emphasis",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Pure terror grips William's chest. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Seeing his mother and sister lying motionless on the floor and his father lunging at him with a bloodied knife and a blank mask, William thought that Charles has completely lost his mind.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "UnloadSprite",
      "speaker": "Charles"
    },
    {
      "name": "UnloadSprite",
      "speaker": "William"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "*Crash! Thud, thud, thud!*",
          "pacing": 0.035,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "William stumbles back, turns, and runs blindly down the back hallway—bursting through the kitchen doors out into the pouring rain.",
          "pacing": 0.04,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Behind him, Charles's angry shouts echo through the empty halls, quickly drowned out by the wind and thunder. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "William runs into the pitch-black forest, his boots slipping in the mud as he crosses the flooded stone bridge leading out of Blackwood Hollow.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He keeps running until the dark shape of Blackwood Manor disappears into the fog behind him, leaving his family, his guilt, and his home.",
          "pacing": 0.05,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}